name: ['Bloodstained Mire', 'Burning Wish', 'Dark Ritual', 'Flooded Strand', 'Maze of Ith', 'Polluted Delta', 'Stifle', 'Survival of the Fittest', 'Windswept Heath', 'Wooded Foothills']
