text: ['Add {B}{B}{B}.', "Counter target activated or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", 'You may reveal a sorcery card you own from outside the game and put it into your hand. Exile Burning Wish.', '{G}, Discard a creature card: Search your library for a creature card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Bloodstained Mire: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Flooded Strand: Search your library for a Plains or Island card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Polluted Delta: Search your library for an Island or Swamp card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Windswept Heath: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Wooded Foothills: Search your library for a Mountain or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}: Untap target attacking creature. Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that creature this turn.']
